                                                "sense_id": "776d2d3e-1588-368e-a0d0-973f593b9931",
                                                "text": "Federal officials examining the horrifying midflight blowout of part of an Alaska Airlines aircraft’s fuselage are testing the detached piece for clues on what led up to the plane’s “explosive decompression” after the missing piece was discovered in an Oregon backyard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f61df8d2-ab42-4ebb-beca-23f0e44b6df8",
                                                "sense_id": "776d2d3e-1588-368e-a0d0-973f593b9931",
                                                "text": "Wichita, Kansas-based Spirit AeroSystems makes major parts of several Boeing models, including the fuselages for the 737 Max."
